<description>&lt;p&gt;Hezbollah continues to launch rockets and artillery at Israeli positions in southern Lebanon while Israel carries out air strikes on Hezbollah sites, causing civilian casualties. Israel reported a controlled detonation of a strike in southern Lebanon, and Lebanese military courts have charged 13 individuals over a seized Hezbollah explosives truck. Lebanon has charged 13 people for confiscated Hezbollah explosives, reflecting heightened security actions. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon, and Qatar has pledged reconstruction funding for the south. The UCDP recorded 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168713&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOVjF2T2lxNDM2ZFQ1cnBQMUQ5Um0xMEp5SlNodFhmQVk4QnczWUFqQjlGSnFjdlp2cTdhV3lfV2pkdHFESUJxQkZLcWpQYi01RTkzbm5Zd2c0ZzV3eVdIeElWWFVkbV9IY2RLckVmVHUyZW5PY1B3MVZhVHlfYzF2VWVUaXc1LVdsQTB1c2Y5dEp1Rjd6VjJQSi1tZmpmV0xsR2FENlU0aktPM1BNTEZSTFp0aw?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNTnlXVnVCelpXY19FSFFwY3NsVWNEZlh4WC1GSUN2aHJ6UEZ2ODFMQjh0aXRaRGlvY3o0WVNNWHBrcXg0U29NR3podTg2X0FXYXZkWEJVUVZxSmF1ZXVmOUVMc2U5SXhXNk0zTWpJd3Q5LWRmdGNlME5Gb0JTNmFVUkxYYkZkT29tbGJ5c0pMRE0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNdGp3UUVBVFNFZG84WTQ2R0R0TWxLdGUxci1PTDhaSzZkTTdVYjFYSHZ5UGc5Rk0tNXdpT0VISFJOQjc3bHF6SjNwYlI3aXhBUkEyWGRkcFZKbmVDY09jWG9UV1R4SE5tU1hpaUpfZ0NIZElJMzlhQjA0TXVFUVh6X2tZQ1lOUjJNU2JNT25Yd2pDaTZ5OGVrZ2UxM1k5WlE3andxOWdHYUFOY2xSTWM1Q1U5RHNyMmRqSXpOREVtWF9TQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=